{"title":"Wreaths","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"ͼ13\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArtificial Christmas Wreaths for a Warm and Welcoming Holiday Home\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas wreaths from King of Christmas add warmth and an inviting touch to your home. Featuring more than just realistic foliage and thoughtful detailing, our wreaths offer the beauty of fresh greenery without any of the maintenance. Whether displayed on your front door, above a fireplace, or as part of your interior décor, our Christmas wreaths make it easy to create an elevated and cohesive holiday look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our full collection of artificial Christmas wreaths to find the perfect style for your home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy choose an artificial Christmas wreath?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas wreaths offer long-lasting beauty and convenience throughout the holiday season. Unlike real wreaths, they won’t dry out or shed needles, making them a low-maintenance option. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eCrafted with high-quality materials, these wreaths are designed to be reused year after year while maintaining their full and realistic appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan artificial Christmas wreaths be used outdoors?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes, many artificial Christmas wreaths are suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, including front door wreaths. For best results, place your wreath in a covered or protected area to help preserve its appearance over time, especially when exposed to direct sunlight or harsh weather. Flocked Christmas wreaths, however, are best suited for indoor or covered outdoor use, as excess moisture can affect their snow-like finish.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat is the most popular size artificial wreath?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe most popular size for artificial Christmas wreaths is around 24 to 26 inches, as it fits proportionally on a standard front door and creates a balanced, eye-catching display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAt King of Christmas, our artificial Christmas wreaths are designed at 26 inches to provide a slightly fuller and more substantial look, making them ideal for both standard and larger entryways.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eLarger Christmas wreaths, typically 28 to 36 inches, are also popular for oversized doors or statement décor, while smaller sizes around 18 to 20 inches are best suited for interior spaces such as windows or mantels.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you're decorating your front door or adding seasonal detail throughout your home, artificial Christmas wreaths offer a timeless and low-maintenance way to enhance your space for the holidays. Explore our collection to find a Christmas wreath that brings lasting beauty and festive charm to any space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"24inch-king-flock-wreath-led","title":"24\" King Flock® Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour winter wonderland collection shouldn't just end at your tree. Bring the enchantment of a dreamy white forest right into your living room, while decorating this holiday season. Composed of the same realistic tips and snow-covered branches, as the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #008000;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, our King Flock Wreath will not disappoint with its effortless and quick shaping process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePre-lit with 50 warm-white LED lights, battery operated and has a built-in automatic timer 6 hours on 18 hours off. The King Flock Wreath is perfect to hang on doors, walls, or by the fireplace mantel. The king flock wreath is a sure way to complete your holiday home decor that's only fit for a king. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"24\" \/ LED","offer_id":28642908307520,"sku":"KF-W24IN-L","price":79.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-4-2_16e530d6-403d-462c-9d8a-64c96691a0be.jpg?v=1714673906"},{"product_id":"24inch-king-flock-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" King Flock® Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour winter wonderland collection shouldn't just end at your tree. Bring the enchantment of a dreamy white forest right into your living room, while decorating this holiday season. From our critically acclaimed \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #008000;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing flock Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, we present the King Flock Wreath. Composed of the same realistic tips and snow-covered branches as the King Flock tree, our King Flock wreath will not disappoint with its effortless and quick shaping process. The king flock wreath is a sure way to complete your holiday home decor that's only fit for a king.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"24\" \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642908405824,"sku":"KF-W24IN-U","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-4-2_b073b94d-d71a-4765-b8d4-9dfd6a8d5071.jpg?v=1714673909"},{"product_id":"24inch-royal-fir-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" Royal Fir Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExtremely intricate with life-like foliage and detailed tips, the Royal Fir line is considered to be one of our premium selections. Assembled with the same materials and quality build as the Royal Fir tree. The Royal Fir Wreath is an excellent choice to compliment our Royal Fir tree. Appropriate for indoor and outdoor use, this wreath is perfect for hanging on doors, walls, or by the fireplace. Set a festive tone this holiday when welcoming your family and friends this season when you choose the royal fir wreath.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642944680000,"sku":"RF-W24IN-U","price":79.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-4.jpg?v=1714674128"},{"product_id":"24-king-douglas-fir-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" King Douglas Fir Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe King Douglas Fir Wreath really stands in a class of its own. Like our King Douglas Fir Tree, it features a crafty combination of classic (PVC) and realistic (PE) tips, producing a truly realistic-looking lush green foliage. Suitable for indoor and outdoor use, the King Douglas Fir Wreath is perfect to hang on doors, walls, or by the fireplace mantel. The King Douglas Fir Wreath is the perfect way to embrace the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642945663040,"sku":"KDF-W24-U","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingDouglasFirWreathUnlit.png?v=1784735554"},{"product_id":"24-king-douglas-fir-wreath-led-battery","title":"24\" King Douglas Fir Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe King Douglas Fir Wreath really stands in a class of its own. Like our King Douglas Fir Tree, it features a crafty combination of classic (PVC) and realistic (PE) tips, producing a truly realistic-looking lush green foliage. Suitable for indoor and outdoor use, the King Douglas Fir Wreath is perfect to hang on doors, walls, or by the fireplace mantel. The King Douglas Fir Wreath is the perfect way to embrace the holiday season. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003ePre-lit with 50 warm-white LED lights, the wreath is battery operated and has a built-in automatic timer 6 hours on 18 hours off.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642945794112,"sku":"KDF-W24IN-Bat","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-douglas-fir-prelit-wreath-battery-operated.jpg?v=1718158160"},{"product_id":"24-yorkshire-fir-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" Yorkshire Fir Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eLike the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/yorkshire-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003eYorkshire Fir Tree\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, King of Christmas’s Yorkshire Fir Wreath is a magnificent addition to your Christmas decor. Constructed with 150 classic tips ensures a full, voluminous shape, being quite the attraction for your door, window, or fireplace. The Yorkshire Fir wreath will be a pleasant extension of all things Christmas, and an excellent way to round out the final decorating touches in your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642946285632,"sku":"YF-W24IN-U","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/yorkshire-fir-wreath.jpg?v=1722014829"},{"product_id":"24-cypress-spruce-wreath","title":"24\" Cypress Spruce Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you place it on your door or on top of your fireplace, the Cypress Spruce Wreath will stand out and demand notice. Inspired by our prestigious \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/cypress-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCypress Spruce Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, this wreath oozes aristocracy and nobility. Designed with the same tasteful blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) as the Cypress Spruce tree, resulting in a grand and beautiful Christmas wreath. Indulge in all things regal by adding the Cypress Spruce Wreath to your Christmas collection this season. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642950086720,"sku":"CS-W24IN","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021cypress-51.jpg?v=1714673746"},{"product_id":"24-cypress-spruce-wreath-led-battery","title":"24\" Cypress Spruce Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you place it on your door or on top of your fireplace, the Cypress Spruce Wreath will stand out and demand notice. Inspired by our prestigious \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/cypress-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eCypress Spruce Tree\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, this wreath oozes aristocracy and nobility. Crafted with the same tasteful blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) as the Cypress Spruce tree, resulting in a grand and beautiful Christmas wreath. This Cypress Spruce Wreath comes Pre-lit with 70 meticulously placed LED lights. All of our pre-lit wreaths are skillfully hand-strung to camouflage the appearance of wires. Indulge in all things regal by adding the Cypress Spruce Wreath to your Christmas collection this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642950348864,"sku":"CS-W24IN-Bat","price":119.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021cypress-51_4e235b9c-c3df-4b1e-9b07-57dbed463599.jpg?v=1714673748"},{"product_id":"36-inch-king-flock-wreath-led","title":"36\" King Flock® Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour winter wonderland collection shouldn't just end at your tree. Bring the enchantment of a dreamy white forest right into your living room, while decorating this holiday season. Composed of the same realistic tips and snow-covered branches, as the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #008000;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, our King Flock Wreath will not disappoint with its effortless and quick shaping process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The King Flock Wreath is perfect to hang on doors, walls, or by the fireplace mantel. The king flock wreath is a sure way to complete your holiday home decor that's only fit for a king. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"36\" \/ LED","offer_id":30080364970048,"sku":"KF-W36IN-L","price":139.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-4-2_1ae28fc2-0549-456c-b65b-d7d61d814517.jpg?v=1714673907"},{"product_id":"36-inch-king-fraser-led","title":"36\" King Fraser Fir Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eKing of Christmas’s King Fraser Fir wreath is a magnificent addition to your Christmas decor. With its green life-like foliage, the king Fraser fir wreath features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting a full, voluminous shape, being quite the attraction for your door or fireplace. The King Fraser Fir Wreath will be a pleasant extension of all things Christmas in your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30080365133888,"sku":"KFF-W36IN-L","price":149.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFrasier-4-2_2068e758-081b-4521-b4fe-a62dc95a5d9a.jpg?v=1714673989"},{"product_id":"24inch-queen-flock-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" Queen Flock® Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExtremely intricate with life-like foliage and detailed tips, the Queen Flock line is considered to be one of our premium selections. Assembled with the same materials and quality build as the Queen Flock tree. The Queen Flock Wreath is an excellent choice to compliment our Queen Flock tree. Appropriate for indoor and outdoor use, this wreath is perfect for hanging on doors, walls, or by the fireplace. Set a festive tone this holiday when welcoming your family and friends this season when you choose the Queen Flock wreath.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284859728072,"sku":"QF-W24IN-U","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021QueenFlock-4-2.jpg?v=1714674059"},{"product_id":"36inch-queen-flock-wreath-led","title":"36\" Queen Flock® Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eKing of Christmas’s Queen Flock wreath is a magnificent addition to your Christmas decor. With its green life-like foliage, the Queen Flock wreath features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting a full, voluminous shape, being quite the attraction for your door or fireplace. Pre-strung with UL warm white LED lights, The Queen Flock wreath will be a pleasant extension of all things Christmas in your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42877971562696,"sku":"QF-W36IN-L","price":139.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KOC2021QueenFlock-4-2_fbd4deca-9624-4a6f-b977-657731f61892.jpg?v=1714674063"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Screenshot_2025-08-21_at_10.22.22_AM.png?v=1761583324","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-wreaths.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}